**Paper**: Recipe for a General, Powerful, Scalable Graph Transformer (GPS) — NeurIPS 2022

**Core Contribution**: A modular, linear-complexity (O(N+E)) graph Transformer recipe that decouples local MPNN from global attention, systematically categorizes PE/SE, and achieves SOTA on 16 diverse benchmarks including large graphs with thousands of nodes.

**Key Takeaways for TopicState**:
