3. **❌ Feature augmentation is marginal**: Repeat unit index adds negligible value.
4. **⚠️ Architecture is the bottleneck**: Even with optimal data transformation (trimer), GIN at 50.19 is far from SOTA 30.8 (PerioGT). Data-centric improvements alone cannot close this gap.

