| GIN+VN | Trimer | 53.78 | ❌ +3.59 |
| GIN+VN | Cyclized | 51.14 | ❌ +0.95 |

**Critical negative finding**: ALL architectural modifications made things WORSE. Attention and virtual nodes increase overfitting, not decrease it. **GIN+Trimer=50.19 remains the best across all 7 combinations.**

