**GPS++: An Optimised Hybrid MPNN/Transformer for Molecular Property Prediction**

**Core Contribution**: First-place solution to OGB-LSC 2022 (PCQM4Mv2), achieving 0.0719 MAE with a 112-model ensemble. The hybrid design allocates 70% of parameters to MPNN for local inductive bias, with biased self-attention (SPD + 3D distance) serving primarily as a channel for injecting geometric priors.

