### What was tested
**BlochSpec**: Computed Bloch band structure features (12 deterministic spectral summaries from chemistry-weighted periodic Laplacian) injected as graph-level features concatenated with GNN embedding in the prediction head. This was meant to bypass the representation-usage gap by shifting periodicity from learned representation space to computed input space.

