|---|---|---|
| PolymerBipartite v2 ~42-45 | H8a validated: node-level injection works | Combine with Chemprop backbone (hybrid) |
| PolymerBipartite v2 ~48-52 | RU nodes provide limited benefit over GIN | Pivot fully to Chemprop |
