**Key context summary:**
- The 50→30 RMSE gap in polymer Tg prediction has resisted THREE exhausted paradigms: (1) contrastive pre-training, (2) GIN architecture innovation, (3) graph-level feature injection
- All produce 50-54 RMSE; SOTA is 30.8 by PerioGT
