**Key Innovation**: Bond-dropping augmentation adapted for Chemprop's directed message structure (each dropped bond removes both forward h_{ij} and reverse h_{ji} message paths — more impactful perturbation than atom-level masking on GIN). Periodic edge is NEVER dropped/masked.

