2. **Redundant Channel Principle (Generalized)**: On small polymer graphs, ANY additional channel (VN, Transformer, spectral features, bipartite structure) is redundant with existing MP. Five empirical confirmations across 5 days. Three boundary conditions where it doesn't apply: large graphs, pre-trained channels, computational graph replacement.

